<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher on Thursday in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 126.87 to 6473.64.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 6.99 to 392.16.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.73.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1806 to 753.</p>
<p>Volume was 522,316,300 compared with 500,398,280 Wednesday.</p>
